SimulationType                MonteCarlo
NumberOfCycles                75000
NumberOfInitializationCycles  50000
PrintEvery                    100
RestartFile                   no

Forcefield                    local

CutOffVDW	14

Box 0 #liquid
BoxLengths XAL XAL XAL
BoxAngles 90 90 90
ExternalTemperature extT
ComputeMolecularPressure yes

Box 1 #vapor
BoxLengths XAV XAV XAV 
BoxAngles 90 90 90
ExternalTemperature extT
ComputeMolecularPressure yes

GibbsVolumeChangeProbability 0.1

Component 0 MoleculeName           		C6_alk
            MoleculeDefinition       		local
	    IdealGasRosenbluthWeight 	   0.0029553
            TranslationProbability   		1
            RotationProbability      		1
	    PartialReinsertionProbability	1
            GibbsSwapProbability     		1
            CreateNumberOfMolecules  300 50 
